WEBVTT

00:09:29.565 --> 00:09:31.233
I did that practice.

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:33.152
Then what happened?

00:09:33.193 --> 00:09:35.279
My body become decayed,

00:09:35.321 --> 00:09:37.865
I cannot see, I cannot hear.

00:09:38.324 --> 00:09:41.327
But my mind becomes so present,

00:09:41.327 --> 00:09:43.037
beyond free.

00:09:44.038 --> 00:09:46.582
And I was in that state for a few hours.

00:09:46.624 --> 00:09:48.792
Luckily, I didn't die, I come back.

00:09:48.834 --> 00:09:51.795
So when I come back,
the street becomes like my home.

00:09:51.795 --> 00:09:55.424
When I look at a tree,
tree becomes like tree of love.

00:09:55.924 --> 00:09:59.803
And the wind blows to my face
become a joyful experience.